  "details": "If a object have OnEnterTrigger and OnExitTrigger, and triggers specify different layers each other, OnExitTrigger is also fired by a object with layer that is specified in OnEnterTrigger (not OnExitTrigger).\n\nExample setup:\nOnEnterTrigger layer A\nOnExitTrigger layer B\n\nWhen Layer B object exit, it fires OnExitTrigger (OK).\nWhen Layer A object exit, it also fires OnExitTrigger. This is not specified.\n\n---\nJapanese:\n一つのオブジェクトに OnEnterTrigger と OnExitTrigger が設定してあり、それぞれの layer が違うものを指している時に、OnExitTrigger が不適切に OnEnterTrigger で指定した layer のオブジェクトでも発火してしまう。",
